{%- comment -%}
  Footer del negozio (section group "footer-group").
  Riferimento: Simple Design System (Figma) → Sections / Footer (colonna brand + liste di link "Text Link List").

  - Newsletter (blocco, al massimo uno): fascia sopra le colonne oppure una colonna. Form condiviso con la section
    newsletter (snippets/newsletter-form.liquid), stato di invio con <contact-form> (contact-form.js, solo se c'è).
  - Colonna brand: logo (o nome del negozio), breve descrizione, link ai social (Impostazioni tema → Social media),
    "Segui su Shop".
  - Colonne: blocchi "Menu" (link_list Shopify), "Testo", "Newsletter" in colonna. Da 990px un binario per blocco,
    in proporzione al contenuto (--footer-columns): funziona con qualsiasi numero di blocchi.
  - Riga finale: copyright, dati aziendali (ragione sociale, sede, P.IVA: in Italia la partita IVA va indicata sul
    sito), link alle policy del negozio, paese/lingua, icone dei metodi di pagamento attivi.
  Stile: solo utility Tailwind.
{%- endcomment -%}
{% render 'section-colors', section_id: section.id, scheme: section.settings.color_scheme %}
{% render 'section-width', section_id: section.id, width: section.settings.section_width %}
{%- liquid
  assign s = section.settings

  # Social: id usato nelle impostazioni tema (social_<id>_link) e nome del brand da mostrare
  assign social_ids = 'instagram,facebook,tiktok,youtube,x,linkedin' | split: ','
  assign social_names = 'Instagram,Facebook,TikTok,YouTube,X,LinkedIn' | split: ','
  assign has_social = false
  for id in social_ids
    assign setting_key = 'social_' | append: id | append: '_link'
    if settings[setting_key] != blank
      assign has_social = true
    endif
  endfor

  assign show_country = false
  if s.show_country and localization.available_countries.size > 1
    assign show_country = true
  endif
  assign show_language = false
  if s.show_language and localization.available_languages.size > 1
    assign show_language = true
  endif

  assign has_policies = false
  if s.show_policies
    for policy in shop.policies
      if policy != blank
        assign has_policies = true
        break
      endif
    endfor
  endif

  # Binari della griglia da 990px: brand più largo, newsletter e testo più larghi dei menu.
  # La newsletter "a fascia" sta sopra la griglia e non ha un binario.
  assign footer_columns = 'minmax(0,1.5fr)'
  assign newsletter_band = nil
  assign has_newsletter = false
  for block in section.blocks
    case block.type
      when 'newsletter'
        assign has_newsletter = true
        if block.settings.layout == 'band'
          assign newsletter_band = block
        else
          assign footer_columns = footer_columns | append: ' minmax(0,1.75fr)'
        endif
      when 'text'
        assign footer_columns = footer_columns | append: ' minmax(0,1.25fr)'
      else
        assign footer_columns = footer_columns | append: ' minmax(0,1fr)'
    endcase
  endfor

  assign logo_width = s.logo_width
  assign logo_width_2x = logo_width | times: 2
  assign logo_widths = logo_width | append: ', ' | append: logo_width_2x
  assign logo_sizes = logo_width | append: 'px'

  assign link_class = 'rounded-sm text-muted underline-offset-4 transition-colors duration-150 hover:text-foreground hover:underline aria-[current=page]:font-semibold aria-[current=page]:text-foreground motion-reduce:transition-none'
  assign heading_class = 'text-body font-semibold text-balance text-headings'
  assign select_class = 'h-11 w-full max-w-64 appearance-none truncate rounded-button border border-input-border bg-input ps-3 pe-9 text-body text-input-foreground hover:border-input-foreground focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-primary'
-%}

<footer class="border-t border-border bg-background">
  {%- comment -%} Newsletter a fascia: titolo a sinistra, form a destra da 990px {%- endcomment -%}
  {%- if newsletter_band -%}
    {%- assign block = newsletter_band -%}
    {%- assign form_id = 'FooterNewsletter-' | append: block.id -%}
    <div class="page-width">
      <contact-form
        class="grid gap-6 border-b border-border py-10 md:py-12 lg:grid-cols-2 lg:items-center lg:gap-12"
        data-sending-label="{{ 'sections.newsletter.sending' | t | escape }}"
        {{ block.shopify_attributes }}
      >
        {%- if block.settings.heading != blank or block.settings.text != blank -%}
          <div class="flex flex-col gap-2">
            {%- if block.settings.heading != blank -%}
              <h2 class="text-heading text-balance text-headings">{{ block.settings.heading | escape }}</h2>
            {%- endif -%}
            {%- if block.settings.text != blank -%}
              <div class="prose prose-theme max-w-xl text-body text-pretty [--tw-prose-body:var(--color-muted)]">
                {{ block.settings.text }}
              </div>
            {%- endif -%}
          </div>
        {%- endif -%}
        {% render 'newsletter-form',
          form_id: form_id,
          tags: block.settings.tags,
          button_label: block.settings.button_label,
          success_message: block.settings.success_message,
          consent: block.settings.consent,
          class: 'w-full lg:max-w-lg lg:justify-self-end'
        %}
      </contact-form>
    </div>
  {%- endif -%}

  {%- comment -%}
    Sotto i 750px i menu stanno affiancati su due colonne, brand, testi e newsletter occupano la riga intera.
    Tra 750 e 990px quattro colonne (brand su due); da 990px un binario per blocco.
  {%- endcomment -%}
  <div
    class="page-width grid grid-cols-2 gap-x-6 gap-y-10 py-12 md:grid-cols-4 md:gap-x-8 md:py-16 lg:grid-cols-(--footer-columns) lg:gap-x-12"
    style="--footer-columns: {{ footer_columns }};"
  >
    {%- comment -%} Colonna brand {%- endcomment -%}
    <div class="col-span-2 flex flex-col items-start gap-5 lg:col-span-1 lg:pe-6">
      <a
        href="{{ routes.root_url }}"
        class="block max-w-full rounded-sm text-headings"
        {% if s.logo != blank %}
          style="--footer-logo-width: {{ logo_width }}px;"
        {% endif %}
      >
        {%- if s.logo != blank -%}
          {{
            s.logo
            | image_url: width: logo_width_2x
            | image_tag:
              loading: 'lazy',
              widths: logo_widths,
              sizes: logo_sizes,
              alt: shop.name,
              class: 'h-auto w-(--footer-logo-width) max-w-full'
          }}
        {%- else -%}
          <span class="font-heading text-heading">{{ shop.name | escape }}</span>
        {%- endif -%}
      </a>

      {%- if s.brand_text != blank -%}
        <div class="prose prose-theme max-w-sm text-body-sm text-pretty [--tw-prose-body:var(--color-muted)]">
          {{ s.brand_text }}
        </div>
      {%- endif -%}

      {%- if s.show_social and has_social -%}
        <ul class="flex flex-wrap gap-x-5 gap-y-2" role="list" aria-label="{{ 'sections.footer.social' | t }}">
          {%- for id in social_ids -%}
            {%- assign setting_key = 'social_' | append: id | append: '_link' -%}
            {%- if settings[setting_key] != blank -%}
              <li>
                <a
                  href="{{ settings[setting_key] }}"
                  class="group/social inline-flex min-h-6 items-center gap-1 rounded-sm text-body-sm font-semibold text-foreground transition-colors duration-150 hover:text-muted motion-reduce:transition-none"
                  target="_blank"
                  rel="noopener"
                >
                  {{- social_names[forloop.index0] -}}
                  {% render 'icon',
                    name: 'arrow-up-right',
                    size: 16,
                    class: 'shrink-0 transition-transform duration-150 ease-theme group-hover/social:translate-x-0.5 group-hover/social:-translate-y-0.5 motion-reduce:transition-none'
                  %}
                  <span class="sr-only"> ({{ 'accessibility.new_window' | t }})</span>
                </a>
              </li>
            {%- endif -%}
          {%- endfor -%}
        </ul>
      {%- endif -%}

      {%- comment -%} Segui su Shop: i colori del pulsante li decide Shopify e non vanno modificati {%- endcomment -%}
      {%- if s.enable_follow_on_shop and shop.features.follow_on_shop? -%}
        <div>{{ shop | login_button: action: 'follow' }}</div>
      {%- endif -%}
    </div>

    {%- comment -%} Colonne (SDS Text Link List) {%- endcomment -%}
    {%- for block in section.blocks -%}
      {%- if block.type == 'newsletter' and block.settings.layout == 'band' -%}
        {%- continue -%}
      {%- endif -%}
      {%- liquid
        case block.type
          when 'link_list'
            assign column_class = 'col-span-1'
          when 'text'
            assign column_class = 'col-span-2 lg:col-span-1'
          when 'newsletter'
            assign column_class = 'col-span-2 md:col-span-4 lg:col-span-1'
        endcase
      -%}

      {%- if block.type == 'newsletter' -%}
        {%- assign form_id = 'FooterNewsletter-' | append: block.id -%}
        <contact-form
          class="{{ column_class }} flex flex-col gap-4"
          data-sending-label="{{ 'sections.newsletter.sending' | t | escape }}"
          {{ block.shopify_attributes }}
        >
          {%- if block.settings.heading != blank -%}
            <h2 class="{{ heading_class }}">{{ block.settings.heading | escape }}</h2>
          {%- endif -%}
          {%- if block.settings.text != blank -%}
            <div class="prose prose-theme max-w-md text-body-sm text-pretty [--tw-prose-body:var(--color-muted)]">
              {{ block.settings.text }}
            </div>
          {%- endif -%}
          {% render 'newsletter-form',
            form_id: form_id,
            tags: block.settings.tags,
            button_label: block.settings.button_label,
            success_message: block.settings.success_message,
            consent: block.settings.consent,
            class: 'w-full md:max-w-lg'
          %}
        </contact-form>
      {%- else -%}
        <div class="{{ column_class }} flex flex-col gap-4" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
          {%- if block.settings.heading != blank -%}
            <h2 class="{{ heading_class }}">{{ block.settings.heading | escape }}</h2>
          {%- endif -%}

          {%- case block.type -%}
            {%- when 'link_list' -%}
              {%- assign links = block.settings.menu.links -%}
              {%- if links.size > 0 -%}
                <ul class="flex flex-col gap-3 text-body" role="list">
                  {%- for link in links -%}
                    <li>
                      <a
                        href="{{ link.url }}"
                        class="{{ link_class }}"
                        {% if link.current %}
                          aria-current="page"
                        {% endif %}
                      >
                        {{- link.title | escape -}}
                        {%- comment -%} Link "Your Privacy Choices" aggiunto da Shopify: l'icona ufficiale è un obbligo di legge negli USA {%- endcomment -%}
                        {%- if link.data_sharing_opt_out_icon -%}
                          {{ ' ' }}{{ link.data_sharing_opt_out_icon }}
                        {%- endif -%}
                      </a>
                    </li>
                  {%- endfor -%}
                </ul>
              {%- endif -%}
            {%- when 'text' -%}
              <div class="prose prose-theme max-w-md text-body-sm text-pretty [--tw-prose-body:var(--color-muted)]">
                {{ block.settings.text }}
              </div>
          {%- endcase -%}
        </div>
      {%- endif -%}
    {%- endfor -%}
  </div>

  {%- comment -%} Riga finale: copyright e dati aziendali a sinistra, paese/lingua e pagamenti a destra da 990px {%- endcomment -%}
  <div class="border-t border-border">
    <div class="page-width flex flex-col gap-6 py-8 lg:flex-row lg:items-end lg:justify-between lg:gap-12">
      <div class="flex min-w-0 flex-col gap-3 text-body-sm text-muted">
        {%- if s.show_copyright or s.company_info != blank -%}
          <div class="flex flex-col gap-1">
            {%- if s.show_copyright -%}
              <p>&copy; {{ 'now' | date: '%Y' }} {{ shop.name | escape }}</p>
            {%- endif -%}
            {%- if s.company_info != blank -%}
              <div class="prose prose-theme max-w-2xl text-body-sm text-pretty [--tw-prose-body:var(--color-muted)] [--tw-prose-links:var(--color-muted)] prose-p:my-1">
                {{ s.company_info }}
              </div>
            {%- endif -%}
          </div>
        {%- endif -%}
        {%- if s.company_info == blank and request.design_mode -%}
          <p class="flex items-center gap-1.5 text-warning-foreground">
            {% render 'icon', name: 'exclamation-triangle', size: 16, class: 'shrink-0' %}
            {{- 'sections.footer.company_info_missing' | t -}}
          </p>
        {%- endif -%}

        {%- if has_policies -%}
          <nav aria-label="{{ 'sections.footer.policies' | t }}">
            <ul class="flex flex-wrap gap-x-5 gap-y-2" role="list">
              {%- for policy in shop.policies -%}
                {%- if policy != blank -%}
                  <li>
                    <a href="{{ policy.url }}" class="{{ link_class }}">{{ policy.title | escape }}</a>
                  </li>
                {%- endif -%}
              {%- endfor -%}
            </ul>
          </nav>
        {%- endif -%}
      </div>

      {%- if show_country or show_language or s.show_payment_icons -%}
        <div class="flex flex-col gap-6 lg:items-end">
          {%- comment -%}
            Paese/valuta e lingua: form 'localization' nativo, funziona senza JS. Si conferma con il pulsante: cambiare
            paese alla sola scelta dell'opzione sarebbe un cambio di contesto inatteso (WCAG 3.2.2), e con le frecce alcuni
            browser lo farebbero a ogni opzione. Solo i selettori con più di un'opzione.
          {%- endcomment -%}
          {%- if show_country or show_language -%}
            {%- form 'localization', id: 'FooterLocalizationForm', class: 'flex flex-wrap items-end gap-3' -%}
              {%- if show_country -%}
                <div class="flex min-w-0 flex-col gap-1">
                  <label for="FooterCountry" class="text-body-sm text-muted">{{ 'general.localization.country_label' | t }}</label>
                  <div class="relative">
                    <select
                      id="FooterCountry"
                      name="country_code"
                      class="{{ select_class }}"
                    >
                      {%- for country in localization.available_countries -%}
                        <option
                          value="{{ country.iso_code }}"
                          {% if country.iso_code == localization.country.iso_code %}
                            selected
                          {% endif %}
                        >
                          {{- country.name | escape }} ({{ country.currency.iso_code }}
                          {%- if country.currency.symbol != country.currency.iso_code %} {{ country.currency.symbol }}{% endif -%}
                          )
                        </option>
                      {%- endfor -%}
                    </select>
                    {% render 'icon', name: 'chevron-up-down', size: 16, class: 'pointer-events-none absolute end-3 top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 text-input-foreground/65' %}
                  </div>
                </div>
              {%- endif -%}
              {%- if show_language -%}
                <div class="flex min-w-0 flex-col gap-1">
                  <label for="FooterLanguage" class="text-body-sm text-muted">{{ 'general.localization.language_label' | t }}</label>
                  <div class="relative">
                    <select
                      id="FooterLanguage"
                      name="language_code"
                      class="{{ select_class }}"
                    >
                      {%- for language in localization.available_languages -%}
                        <option
                          value="{{ language.iso_code }}"
                          lang="{{ language.iso_code }}"
                          {% if language.iso_code == localization.language.iso_code %}
                            selected
                          {% endif %}
                        >
                          {{- language.endonym_name | capitalize -}}
                        </option>
                      {%- endfor -%}
                    </select>
                    {% render 'icon', name: 'chevron-up-down', size: 16, class: 'pointer-events-none absolute end-3 top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 text-input-foreground/65' %}
                  </div>
                </div>
              {%- endif -%}
              <button type="submit" class="button button-neutral">{{ 'general.localization.submit' | t }}</button>
            {%- endform -%}
          {%- endif -%}

          {%- if s.show_payment_icons and shop.enabled_payment_types.size > 0 -%}
            <div>
              <span class="sr-only">{{ 'sections.footer.payment_methods' | t }}</span>
              <ul class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 lg:justify-end" role="list">
                {%- for type in shop.enabled_payment_types -%}
                  <li>{{ type | payment_type_svg_tag: class: 'h-6 w-auto' }}</li>
                {%- endfor -%}
              </ul>
            </div>
          {%- endif -%}
        </div>
      {%- endif -%}
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>

{%- if has_newsletter -%}
  {% render 'vite-tag-deferred', entry: 'contact-form.js', section_index: section.index %}
{%- endif -%}

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "t:sections.footer.name",
  "tag": "div",
  "class": "section-footer",
  "enabled_on": {
    "groups": [
      "footer"
    ]
  },
  "settings": [
    {
      "type": "select",
      "id": "section_width",
      "label": "t:sections.footer.settings.section_width.label",
      "info": "t:sections.footer.settings.section_width.info",
      "options": [
        {
          "value": "page",
          "label": "t:sections.footer.settings.section_width.options.page"
        },
        {
          "value": "full",
          "label": "t:sections.footer.settings.section_width.options.full"
        }
      ],
      "default": "page"
    },
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "t:sections.footer.settings.header_3.content"
    },
    {
      "type": "image_picker",
      "id": "logo",
      "label": "t:sections.footer.settings.logo.label",
      "info": "t:sections.footer.settings.logo.info"
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "logo_width",
      "label": "t:sections.footer.settings.logo_width.label",
      "min": 50,
      "max": 250,
      "step": 10,
      "unit": "t:sections.footer.settings.logo_width.unit",
      "default": 120
    },
    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "brand_text",
      "label": "t:sections.footer.settings.brand_text.label",
      "info": "t:sections.footer.settings.brand_text.info"
    },
    {
      "type": "checkbox",
      "id": "show_social",
      "label": "t:sections.footer.settings.show_social.label",
      "info": "t:sections.footer.settings.show_social.info",
      "default": true
    },
    {
      "type": "checkbox",
      "id": "enable_follow_on_shop",
      "label": "t:sections.footer.settings.enable_follow_on_shop.label",
      "info": "t:sections.footer.settings.enable_follow_on_shop.info",
      "default": false
    },
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "t:sections.footer.settings.header_4.content"
    },
    {
      "type": "checkbox",
      "id": "show_copyright",
      "label": "t:sections.footer.settings.show_copyright.label",
      "info": "t:sections.footer.settings.show_copyright.info",
      "default": true
    },
    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "company_info",
      "label": "t:sections.footer.settings.company_info.label",
      "info": "t:sections.footer.settings.company_info.info"
    },
    {
      "type": "checkbox",
      "id": "show_policies",
      "label": "t:sections.footer.settings.show_policies.label",
      "info": "t:sections.footer.settings.show_policies.info",
      "default": true
    },
    {
      "type": "checkbox",
      "id": "show_payment_icons",
      "label": "t:sections.footer.settings.show_payment_icons.label",
      "default": true
    },
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "t:sections.footer.settings.header_2.content"
    },
    {
      "type": "checkbox",
      "id": "show_country",
      "label": "t:sections.footer.settings.show_country.label",
      "info": "t:sections.footer.settings.show_country.info",
      "default": true
    },
    {
      "type": "checkbox",
      "id": "show_language",
      "label": "t:sections.footer.settings.show_language.label",
      "info": "t:sections.footer.settings.show_language.info",
      "default": true
    },
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "t:sections.footer.settings.header_1.content"
    },
    {
      "type": "color_scheme",
      "id": "color_scheme",
      "label": "t:sections.footer.settings.color_scheme.label",
      "info": "t:sections.footer.settings.color_scheme.info",
      "default": "scheme-1"
    }
  ],
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "link_list",
      "name": "t:sections.footer.blocks.link_list.name",
      "settings": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "heading",
          "label": "t:sections.footer.blocks.link_list.settings.heading.label",
          "default": "t:sections.footer.blocks.link_list.settings.heading.default"
        },
        {
          "type": "link_list",
          "id": "menu",
          "label": "t:sections.footer.blocks.link_list.settings.menu.label",
          "default": "footer"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "name": "t:sections.footer.blocks.text.name",
      "settings": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "heading",
          "label": "t:sections.footer.blocks.text.settings.heading.label",
          "default": "t:sections.footer.blocks.text.settings.heading.default"
        },
        {
          "type": "richtext",
          "id": "text",
          "label": "t:sections.footer.blocks.text.settings.text.label",
          "default": "t:sections.footer.blocks.text.settings.text.default"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "newsletter",
      "name": "t:sections.newsletter.name",
      "limit": 1,
      "settings": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "heading",
          "label": "t:sections.newsletter.settings.heading.label",
          "default": "t:sections.newsletter.settings.heading.default"
        },
        {
          "type": "richtext",
          "id": "text",
          "label": "t:sections.newsletter.settings.text.label",
          "default": "t:sections.newsletter.settings.text.default"
        },
        {
          "type": "select",
          "id": "layout",
          "label": "t:sections.newsletter.settings.layout.label",
          "options": [
            {
              "value": "band",
              "label": "t:sections.footer.blocks.newsletter.settings.layout.options.band"
            },
            {
              "value": "column",
              "label": "t:sections.footer.blocks.newsletter.settings.layout.options.column"
            }
          ],
          "default": "band"
        },
        {
          "type": "header",
          "content": "t:sections.newsletter.settings.header_1.content"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "button_label",
          "label": "t:sections.newsletter.settings.button_label.label",
          "default": "t:sections.newsletter.settings.button_label.default"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "success_message",
          "label": "t:sections.newsletter.settings.success_message.label",
          "default": "t:sections.newsletter.settings.success_message.default"
        },
        {
          "type": "select",
          "id": "consent",
          "label": "t:sections.newsletter.settings.consent.label",
          "info": "t:sections.newsletter.settings.consent.info",
          "options": [
            {
              "value": "checkbox",
              "label": "t:sections.newsletter.settings.consent.options.checkbox"
            },
            {
              "value": "notice",
              "label": "t:sections.newsletter.settings.consent.options.notice"
            }
          ],
          "default": "checkbox"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "tags",
